From 3d3980b14b9d00236f89cba5ad56a7a098ed15ef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:20:53 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] d/steamvr_lh: stabilize against selected base station

Opt in with an explicit reference serial and normalize composed poses to the base origin before history insertion. Match sample timestamps and world transforms to bounded reference epochs, hold known corrections for static references, and invalidate unmatched generations. Rotate velocities without introducing correction-switch velocities. Preserve raw recordings and add corrected poses and state diagnostics. Report reference discovery through a startup callback for WiVRn candidate persistence. Test math, generation boundaries, real Device history/prediction, loss and restart behavior.
